        "evidence": "rho-s3-holonomy-exposition.md:37-41 'Together, α and β generate the Klein four-group V_4 ... and their composition αβ : w ↦ (w_3,w_4,w_1,w_2) is the 3-cycle whose cube returns to the identity on SO(3)'",
        "notes": "Self-contradictory and false. Verified by direct computation: α=(w1,w2,w3,w4)→(w2,w1,w4,w3) and β→(w4,w3,w2,w1) are both order-2; their composition αβ→(w3,w4,w1,w2) is a DOUBLE TRANSPOSITION of ORDER 2, not a 3-cycle. (αβ)^3 = αβ ≠ id; (αβ)^2 = id. A 3-cycle has order 3 and cannot exist in V_4 (every non-identity element of V_4 has order 2). Also the closing claim (l.42-43) that 'the full S_3 holonomy is generated by these rotations and reflections' is inconsistent with the V_4 claim: |V_4|=4 ≠ |S_3|=6, V_4 ≇ S_3, and S_3 is non-abelian while V_4 is abelian."
